  "hints": [
    {
      "level": 1,
      "type": "diagram",
      "content": "CPU 并没有专门的「循环指令」：只要在重复代码开头放一个 loop: 标签，末尾写 j loop 往回跳，并在开头用 blt t0, t2, done 检查是否已经超过 n。"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "type": "steps",
      "content": "1. 初始化 t1 = 0（累加和）、t2 = 1（当前数）；2. loop: 若 t0 < t2 跳到 done；3. t1 = t1 + t2；4. t2 = t2 + 1；5. j loop；6. done:。"
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "type": "snippet",
      "content": "addi t1, zero, 0\naddi t2, zero, 1\nloop:\nblt  t0, t2, done\nadd  t1, t1, t2\naddi t2, t2, 1\nj    loop\ndone:"
    }
  ],
